+--EXPECT--
 pcntl_getpriority(): Argument #2 ($mode) must be one of PRIO_PGRP, PRIO_USER, or PRIO_PROCESS
-
-Warning: pcntl_getpriority(): Error %d: No process was located using the given parameters in %s
